    "A composite score based on your sleep duration and sleep efficiency. It evaluates both how long you slept and how effectively you used your time in bed." : {
      "comment" : "Sleep description",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A composite score based on your sleep duration and sleep efficiency. It evaluates both how long you slept and how effectively you used your time in bed."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un score composite basé sur la durée et l'efficacité de votre sommeil. Il évalue à la fois la durée de votre sommeil et l'efficacité avec laquelle vous avez utilisé votre temps au lit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A daily score measuring how close you are to your personal activity goals. Combines steps (30%), active calories (35%), and exercise minutes (35%). Calories and exercise targets are read from your Apple Activity Rings for a personalized score." : {
      "comment" : "Effort description",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A daily score measuring how close you are to your personal activity goals. Combines steps (30%), active calories (35%), and exercise minutes (35%). Calories and exercise targets are read from your Apple Activity Rings for a personalized score."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un score quotidien mesurant votre progression vers vos objectifs d'activité personnels. Combine les pas (30 %), les calories actives (35 %) et les minutes d'exercice (35 %). Les objectifs de calories et d'exercice sont lus depuis vos Anneaux d'Activité Apple pour un score personnalisé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A request is already in progress. Please wait for it to finish." : {
